  (text "USB-C sink, 5.1k CC pull-downs (default USB power).\nTotal VBUS load ~0.9 A: use a 5 V / >=1.5 A USB-C supply.\nD+/D- (both orientations) -> USBLC6-2SC6 ESD -> USB_DP/DM to the STM32G474 (mcu_if)." (at 19.05 86.36 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 75346685-f479-5c5f-a9d8-c7fd0ce52164))
